 in your grasp. The instrument is typical for its type, but it plays only for you. It vanishes when the spell ends. If you cast <em>summon instrument</em> again, any instrument you previously summoned disappears.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The instrument is instead a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.equipment.Item.3ld14dsn2RLu9owg]{Musical Instrument (Virtuoso handheld)}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"summon-instrument","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"3"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"B8bhnzyijDAiM5bV"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.yvs1zN5Pai5U4CJX","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"jdcVYKrimvkTQTfp"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"void-healing","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"jmXSu9mpQqZv5Ffx"},{"type":"action","name":"Stormbound","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A storm conductor can't enter buildings or underground areas. They must remain outside under an open sky.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"mVAAmzVoC5KhGsCc","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Conductor's Rebuke","system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 60 feet that the storm conductor can hear fails a Performance check</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> A bolt of lightning emerges from the sky and zaps the creature who offends the storm conductor's ears. The triggering creature takes @Damage[4d12[electricity]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic] save). On a failure, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for one round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"dB5Rf0sRpr2ogyep","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"LOmu7fmjWOthtbvt","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Rejuvenation","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":true,"description":{"value":"<p>When a storm conductor is destroyed, they re-form after [[/gmr 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days} within 100 feet of where they were previously destroyed, fully healed. A storm conductor can be permanently destroyed only if they hear a truly inspiring and flawless concert.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":["divine"],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"ghost-rejuvenation","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.bestiary-family-ability-glossary.Item.unR8VVR4yyRnsmnB","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"zYSosloAKIdKPonx"},{"type":"action","name":"Tuneless Target","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>If the storm conductor takes sonic damage, they become consumed with rage directed at the source of the offensive discordance. Until the end of their next turn, all of the storm conductor's offensive actions must target the source of the damage. If the storm conductor took sonic damage from multiple sources, they can choose these targets from among them.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"yKhJBAOuhbaA5KTa","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Ghostly Baton","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["finesse","magical"]},"damageRolls":{"dLsfRNuMLiP4Ix4V":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"void","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":19},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"wLnr87SD7cd3aqWU","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Shocking Glare","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity","magical","range-60"]},"damageRolls":{"3nod3VwGDX0v4W1A":{"damage":"2d12+2","damageType":"electricity","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":19},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"wjzEZ3bGRiVILDP7","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Tuning","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The storm conductor attempts to prime their unwilling subjects for the coming performance. The conductor attempts a @Check[performance|against:will] check against the Will DCs of each enemy within 30 feet.</p><hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Tuning for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature must @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.EEDElIyin4z60PXx]{Perform} or use another action that requires a Performance check as it first action on its next turn.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"mlodVcAWl4X7cs4i","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":1600000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}